WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:01.660
Speaker 1: We're starting today with the president.

00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:06.900
Yes, the president, Joe Biden, who is showing
more signs of life than we've seen for months

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:09.240
from the standpoint of his presidency.

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:17.090
Joe Biden, riding high on a number of major
accomplishments, went to Wilkes-Barre, Pennsylvania,

00:00:17.090 --> 00:00:24.390
yesterday, and he absolutely crushed Republicans,
Republicans who are now openly threatening

00:00:24.390 --> 00:00:25.390
violence.

00:00:25.390 --> 00:00:30.070
We covered two days ago Republican Senator
Lindsey Graham saying if Trump is indicted,

00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:31.779
there will be riots in the street.

00:00:31.779 --> 00:00:34.579
Yeah, it'll be Trumpists rioting in the streets.

00:00:34.579 --> 00:00:41.520
We know Lindsey and Joe Biden with I have
to say, I you know, I'm not adding a value

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:48.260
judgment to this, but Joe Biden more fired
up an energetic I would argue that I have

00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:55.219
seen him his entire presidency as we are now,
just weeks from the 2022 midterms on which

00:00:55.219 --> 00:00:57.160
so much ride.

00:00:57.160 --> 00:00:58.160
Take a look at this.

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:02.829
Speaker 2: Let me say this to my MAGA Republican
friends in Congress.

00:01:02.829 --> 00:01:03.829
Yeah.

00:01:03.829 --> 00:01:06.460
Don't tell me you support law enforcement.

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:10.040
If you all condemn what happened on the sixth.

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:11.660
Right.

00:01:11.660 --> 00:01:16.530
Don't tell me.

00:01:16.530 --> 00:01:18.150
Right.

00:01:18.150 --> 00:01:23.020
Can't do it.

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:25.410
For God's sake, whose side are you on?

00:01:25.410 --> 00:01:26.530
Not long.

00:01:26.530 --> 00:01:29.610
Cause side are you on?

00:01:29.610 --> 00:01:31.390
Look.

00:01:31.390 --> 00:01:33.170
Simple.

00:01:33.170 --> 00:01:43.850
Here you are, on the side of a mob, on the
side of the police.

00:01:43.850 --> 00:01:47.640
You can't be pro law enforcement and pro insurrection.

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:54.930
You can't be a party of law and order and
call the people who attacked the police on

00:01:54.930 --> 00:01:55.979
January six.

00:01:55.979 --> 00:01:57.399
Patriots Right.

00:01:57.399 --> 00:02:00.899
You can't do it.

00:02:00.899 --> 00:02:02.729
What are we teaching our children?

00:02:02.729 --> 00:02:05.909
It's just that simple.

00:02:05.909 --> 00:02:13.770
But now it's sickening to see the new attacks
and the FBI threatening life as law enforcement

00:02:13.770 --> 00:02:20.810
agents and their families for simply carrying
out the law and doing their job.

00:02:20.810 --> 00:02:21.990
Look.

00:02:21.990 --> 00:02:31.520
Speaker 1: Listen, we saw this type of thing
from California Governor Gavin Newsom about

00:02:31.520 --> 00:02:32.610
a month ago.

00:02:32.610 --> 00:02:38.400
And I told you that without endorsing his
entire political worldview, that it was the

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:44.190
exact right approach to dealing with these
modern MAGA Republicans.

00:02:44.190 --> 00:02:46.820
Democrats have to be aggressive.

00:02:46.820 --> 00:02:48.990
Democrats in some cases have to be ruthless.

00:02:48.990 --> 00:02:50.810
It doesn't mean we do the things they do.

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:53.480
We don't tell lies we don't dare.

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:57.770
But we have to adopt this approach.

00:02:57.770 --> 00:03:03.000
And Democrats should be looking at the approach
that Gavin Newsom is taking.

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:06.600
Democrats should be looking at this particular
version of Joe Biden.

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:09.840
And just think about the opposite for a second.

00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:17.120
Imagine if you had Democrats openly threatening
law enforcement in the way that Republicans

00:03:17.120 --> 00:03:18.420
have done.

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:23.620
After January, January 6th, excuse me, after
the search warrant being carried out at Mar

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:27.710
a Lago, just as the Republicans would be saying,
forget about due process.

00:03:27.710 --> 00:03:29.580
Throw them in prison for life.

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:33.910
And I was glad to also see Joe Biden call
out Lindsey Graham.

00:03:33.910 --> 00:03:43.820
Lindsey Graham, who predicted by which I mean
threatened or promised riots if Donald Trump

00:03:43.820 --> 00:03:45.300
were to be indicted.

00:03:45.300 --> 00:03:48.360
It's a great thing that Joe Biden is going
right after him as well.

00:03:48.360 --> 00:03:51.920
Speaker 2: No one expects politics to be a
patty cake.

00:03:51.920 --> 00:03:55.130
Hey, sometimes he is mean is hell.

00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:59.990
But the idea you turn on the television is
to senior senators and congressmen saying

00:03:59.990 --> 00:04:05.150
if such and such happens, there will be blood
in the street.

00:04:05.150 --> 00:04:06.150
Where the hell are we?

00:04:06.150 --> 00:04:07.150
Speaker 1: Right.

00:04:07.150 --> 00:04:10.740
And of course, a direct reference there to
Lindsey Graham.

00:04:10.740 --> 00:04:14.170
This is a much more interesting Joe Biden.

00:04:14.170 --> 00:04:17.230
Look at the Joe Biden of the last three months.

00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:24.160
Number one, rhetorically fiery, again energetic,
accomplished more during his COVID isolation

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:27.870
than Trump did his entire presidency, if you
can imagine that.

00:04:27.870 --> 00:04:30.030
And now we see a great jobs report.

00:04:30.030 --> 00:04:31.200
Inflation is down.

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:32.920
Gas prices are down.

00:04:32.920 --> 00:04:35.500
The Inflation Reduction Act has been passed.

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:37.900
The Pact Act, the infrastructure bill.

00:04:37.900 --> 00:04:38.951
I mean, I could go on and on.

00:04:38.951 --> 00:04:41.480
I'm not going to give you the full list every
single time.

00:04:41.480 --> 00:04:45.760
But accomplishment after accomplishment after
accomplishment.

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:49.322
This is a very different Joe Biden than we
saw earlier in the presidency or sort of in

00:04:49.322 --> 00:04:51.290
the middle of the presidency.

00:04:51.290 --> 00:04:57.980
And it's also a Democratic Party whose chances
in November of 2022 are looking dramatically

00:04:57.980 --> 00:04:58.980
better.

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:00.450
So we're going to follow it very closely.

00:05:00.450 --> 00:05:03.870
And by the way, in the middle of all of this.

00:05:03.870 --> 00:05:13.460
We are seeing some Republicans, some Republicans
so disgusted by the low quality candidates

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:19.530
that their primary voters have selected to
represent them in November, that in some races,

00:05:19.530 --> 00:05:21.730
Republicans are increasingly endorsing Democrats.

00:05:21.730 --> 00:06:33.250
And that's what we're going to talk about
next.

